# =============================================================================
# Docker Build Context — opshub-api
# =============================================================================
# Keep this file tight: every byte sent to the daemon slows "docker build".
# Rule: only source files and config needed to BUILD should reach the daemon.
# Runtime artefacts (dist/, node_modules/) are generated inside the container.
# =============================================================================

# ── Installed packages (re-installed inside container) ───────────────────────
# Both forms: `node_modules` binds the root and `**/node_modules` every workspace member (apps/web's
# dependency tree is never needed — the image installs its own).
node_modules
**/node_modules
.pnpm-store

# ── Compiled output (generated inside container) ─────────────────────────────
dist
apps/web/dist

# ── Secrets — NEVER in an image ──────────────────────────────────────────────
# Every level: a workstation's root .env AND a checked-out member's (.env.local in apps/web).
# .env.example is excluded too now: nothing in a build reads it, and it is not worth the exception.
.env
**/.env*
.env.local
.env.*.local
.env.development
.env.test
.env.production

# ── Git internals ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.git
.gitattributes
.husky

# ── IDE / editor artefacts ───────────────────────────────────────────────────
.vscode
.idea
.cursor
*.swp
*.swo
*~
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# ── Test files and coverage ───────────────────────────────────────────────────
coverage
.nyc_output
*.spec.ts
*.test.ts
test
__tests__

# ── Documentation (not needed at runtime) ────────────────────────────────────
*.md
docs

# ── CI / CD configs ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.github
.gitlab-ci.yml
.circleci

# ── Docker files themselves ───────────────────────────────────────────────────
Dockerfile*
.dockerignore
docker-compose*.yml

# ── Logs and temp files ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────
logs
*.log
.tmp
.temp
*.pid
*.seed
*.pid.lock
.agent-logs

# ── TypeScript build info (re-generated during build) ────────────────────────
*.tsbuildinfo

# ── Dev-only tooling configs (linting, formatting) ───────────────────────────
.eslintcache
.prettierignore
.editorconfig

# ── Lock files for other package managers ────────────────────────────────────
package-lock.json
yarn.lock

# ── Misc ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.cache
.turbo
scripts/
